      "Island hopping and multi-country packages: ready-made and tailor-made routes with ferries, speedboats, domestic flights, hotels and transfers in one price and real hop times",
      "Tours and day trips: temple and heritage walks (Angkor, Bagan, Ayutthaya), city tours, hill-tribe and highland treks, jungle and river expeditions, small groups with licensed guides only",
      "Ethical wildlife policy: elephant sanctuaries and conservation projects only — no riding, no performance shows, verified before listing",
