      "Food and culture: night markets and street-food walks, cooking classes, chef-at-the-villa, restaurant reservations, artisan and craft-village visits",
      "Wellness: Thai and Balinese spa days, yoga and detox retreats, wellness weeks, therapist visits to the villa",
      "Adventure: quad, buggy and ATV trails, canyoning and rafting, volcano sunrise treks, paintball, e-bike and motorbike routes",
